{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"736447039520636998","content":"Ophelia wakes slowly.  Her face and eyes hurting from crying herself to sleep over Amaras decision to go. She shivers as a cold realization settles over her that her sister never came back. She started to tear realizing she knew that when her sis stepped out that door. She wipes the tears from her eyes and slowly stands. She reads the letter and holds the necklace. She has a choice to make. Be sad and angry or prove to herself that and Amara that she can trust and open herself to making new friends. Make a family with those friends. A family that they always wanted. Their new start. She stands makes Amaras bed. Put on the necklace she left and says. \"I love you sis! I will try my best to make my life the one you wanted for me.\"\n\n||\"Andy I know you are hurt and angry right now but we have work to do. Let's make her proud.\"||","created_at":"2020-07-31T18:28:37.239000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738825463614537789","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
